  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252falacrity-jei-support\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/alacrity-jei-support\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a></p><hr><p>一款<strong>非官方相容包</strong>，旨在讓 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Items (JEI)</a> 模組的美術風格與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/alacrity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alacrity</a> 資源包完美搭配。本相容包<strong>100% 完成</strong>，且完全支援 <strong>8 個 JEI 附加模組</strong>。建議使用標有<strong>[★]</strong>的附加模組，因為它們在大多數情況下表現最佳。</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-resources-jer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[★] Just Enough Resources</a>：生物掉落｜戰利品箱｜植物｜附魔｜村民交易｜世界生成</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-freaky-additions-jefa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[★] Just Enough Freaky Additions</a>：生物互動｜試煉密室戰利品｜豬布林以物易物｜HOTV 獎勵｜釣魚戰利品｜貓咪禮物</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-effect-descriptions-jeed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[★] Just Enough Effect Descriptions</a>：顯示狀態效果的來源與詳細資訊</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jea\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Advancements</a>：可在 JEI 中搜尋進度</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-archaeology\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Archaeology</a>：顯示可疑的沙、礫石及嗅探獸中發現的物品</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-beacons-reforged\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Beacons Reforged</a>：烽火台基底方塊與供給物｜海靈核心框架方塊</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jepp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Painting Previews</a>：畫作的名稱、預覽圖與尺寸</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-professions-jep\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Professions</a>：每位村民職業的工作台</li>\n</ul><p><strong>注意事項：</strong></p><ul>\n<li>不相容於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/justenoughbreeding\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Breeding</a></li>\n<li>需要安裝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Items (JEI)</a> 才能運作。</li>\n<li><strong>附加模組可選安裝</strong>。請根據個人喜好選擇合適的模組，不安裝任何附加模組也沒問題。</li>\n<li>為達最佳體驗，請搭配 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/alacrity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alacrity</a> 資源包一起使用。</li>\n<li>如有錯誤回報或建議，請透過 <strong>Discord（@thedatthai）</strong>私訊我。</li>\n</ul><p><strong>致謝：</strong></p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/satellence/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Satellence</a>：Alacrity 創作者與先前的 JEI 19.2.0 支援</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/mezz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">mezz</a>：Just Enough Items (JEI) 創作者</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/way2muchnoise\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">way2muchnoise</a>：Just Enough Resources 創作者</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/wachipayoxx64\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wachipayoxx64</a>：Just Enough Freaky Additions 創作者</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/mehvahdjukaar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MehVahdJukaar</a>：Just Enough Effect Descriptions 與 Painting Previews 創作者</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/melanx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MelanX</a>：Just Enough Advancements 創作者</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/lobsterjonn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">LobsterJonn</a>：Just Enough Archaeology 創作者</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/cerbon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cerbon</a>：Just Enough Beacons Reforged 創作者</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/mrbysco\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mrbysco</a>：Just Enough Professions 創作者</li>\n</ul>",
